    "title": "Divorce Katya Lel said that she dated the influential men",
    "text": "Singer Katya Lel attended the Fashion People Awards ceremony 2025. The event also had the participation of the Passion website, who found out whether the diluted executive was taking place during the day.\nKatya Lel divorced her husband after 15 years of marriage. The couple broke up in 2023. Now the singer has no relationship. Sometimes, she goes dating when she has time and mood. They are invited to both influential and simpler men.\nThey really invite. I rarely go, because this is necessary for time and desire. Different men invite, including influence, Lel said.\nIf the artist doesn't like something, then she left. According to Katya, in this case, men understand that something is wrong.\nThe previous singer Alekandra Safelyeva maintained his relationship with spouses Kirill Safonov. The stars have been married for 15 years.",
